meta {
  name: auth
}

docs {
  # Auth flow (US-1.4)

  Run with "Run Folder" so requests execute in order — the session cookie
  set by 01-signup carries over to the requests that need it (Bruno keeps a
  cookie jar per domain). Requires `npm run docker:dev` running locally.

  01 signup -> 02 signup rejects the same email -> 03 me works ->
  04 logout -> 05 me fails (session actually deleted) -> 06 login ->
  07 login rejects a wrong password -> 08 login rejects an unknown email
  the same way (no account enumeration).
}
